\par\par \b \uc2  IMM speculators still net long vs the dollar - CFTC. \b0\par\par\uc2 557 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juni 2002\par 22:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  Kyle Peterson \par \par \uc2  CHICAGO, June 7 (Reuters) - Speculators in several key \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures on the International Monetary Market retained or extended net long positions in the one-week period ended June 4, according data released on Friday by the Commodity Futures Trading Commission. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the situation suggests that speculators are reaching extreme short dollar positions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as a whole. The consequence soon will be a move up for the greenback, they said. \par \par \uc2  "Overall, the IMM data seems to be suggestive of a corrective move in the dollar in the weeks ahead," said Andrew Delano, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at IDEAglobal. "CTAs (Commodity Trading Advisors) and similar funds are bearish on the dollar and are positioned accordingly." \par \par \uc2  The CFTC's weekly IMM Commitments of Traders report on speculative positioning is used by many analysts as a reverse indicator of future market direction. Extreme net long speculative positions often presage a fall in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as a turn in the market, which forces the speculators to fall in line with the more influential players. \par \par \uc2  Speculators in euro futures scaled back a net long position, although that position remains near the record large long position reached in early May. The net long position as of June 4 was 31,616, compared with the record long position of 35,433. \par \par \uc2  Euro futures have enjoyed consistent gains since January reaching as high on Friday as $0.9487 cents a high for the June contract. \par \par \uc2  "There was a little bit of profit taking in the euro," Delano said. "But what we're looking at is a very long spec market in the euro." \par \par \uc2  Speculators in Canadian dollar futures extended a net long positions to its largest since January 2000 with June Canadian dollars notching an 11-month high of $0.6559 on June 5. The contract since has trimmed some of those gains. \par \par \uc2  "We're getting to a point that historically has been a peak in speculator positioning," Delano said. "I think speculators are going to be keen to take profits." \par \par \uc2  Speculators in yen futures trimmed a large net long position for the second consecutive week to 8,375 contracts from 13,862 on May 21. \par \par \uc2  June yen climbed as high as $0.008148 on May 30, but it spent this week consolidating those gains. \par \par \uc2  "The IMM is still very long," Delano said. He added that recent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  has put a lid on yen gains at least temporarily. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  four times in the last two weeks to weaken the yen, which some Japanese officials have complained is inappropriately strong and a threat to the Japanese export market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have slowed the dollar decline and kept the greenback from revisiting the six-month low of 122.77 yen reached on May 30. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, speculators in Mexican peso futures logged their largest net short position on record. The group has been extending the net short position since late March as the June peso contract has tumbled. \par \par \uc2  Delano said the extremely short net position hinted that a rebound in Mexican pesos is on the horizon. \par \par \uc2  "I think the Mexican peso might be getting the strongest support signal of all the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  contracts," he said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020607dy67013nt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
